</metadata></record><record><header><identifier>oai:repositorio.ufmg.br:1843/50076</identifier><datestamp>2026-03-09T14:05:19Z</datestamp><setSpec>com_1843_6</setSpec><setSpec>com_1843_2</setSpec><setSpec>col_1843_223</setSpec></header><metadata><oai_dc:dc xmlns:oai_dc="http://www.openarchives.org/OAI/2.0/oai_dc/" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:doc="http://www.lyncode.com/xoai" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.openarchives.org/OAI/2.0/oai_dc/ http://www.openarchives.org/OAI/2.0/oai_dc.xsd">
   <dc:title>As reformas legislativas na recorribilidade extraordinária: a Emenda Constitucional n° 125/2022 e tendências pela ótica do processualismo constitucional democrático</dc:title>
   <dc:creator>Cícero de Barros Lisboa</dc:creator>
   <dc:subject>Direito constitucional - Emendas</dc:subject>
   <dc:subject>Processo civil</dc:subject>
   <dc:subject>Reforma legislativa</dc:subject>
   <dc:subject>Reformas processuais</dc:subject>
   <dc:subject>Modelo constitucional de processo</dc:subject>
   <dc:subject>Recorribilidade extraordinária</dc:subject>
   <dc:description>With the enactment of Constitutional Amendment No. 125/2022, the extraordinary appealability system underwent a significant change, fostering the debate on the path of legislative reforms in this area in the Brazilian Civil Procedure. It is urgent to understand the motivating interests of the reforms within the scope of the superior courts, which studies and monitoring are used as guidelines for these reforms, and what are the effective changes that EC125 will bring aims to point out the impacts of applying the institute of relevance as a requirement of the Special Appeal,
from the enactment of Constitutional Amendment n° 125, and whether these changes are the best way for legislative reforms in the extraordinary appealability in Brazil, under the prism of Democratic Constitutional Processulism and the constitutional model of Process.</dc:description>
   <dc:description>CAPES - Coordenação de Aperfeiçoamento de Pessoal de Nível Superior</dc:description>
