</metadata></record><record><header><identifier>oai:repositorio.ufmg.br:1843/2022</identifier><datestamp>2026-03-06T20:19:43Z</datestamp><setSpec>com_1843_3</setSpec><setSpec>col_1843_434</setSpec></header><metadata><oai_dc:dc xmlns:oai_dc="http://www.openarchives.org/OAI/2.0/oai_dc/" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:doc="http://www.lyncode.com/xoai" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.openarchives.org/OAI/2.0/oai_dc/ http://www.openarchives.org/OAI/2.0/oai_dc.xsd">
   <dc:title>Parque Nacional do Itatiaia e a Proposta de sua Criação</dc:title>
   <dc:title>Itatiaia National Park and the Proposal for its Creation</dc:title>
   <dc:creator>Raquel Ferreira de Souza</dc:creator>
   <dc:creator>Maria Cristina Rosa</dc:creator>
   <dc:subject>Parque Nacional do Itatiaia</dc:subject>
   <dc:subject>Parque Nacional do Itatiaia</dc:subject>
   <dc:subject>Parque</dc:subject>
   <dc:subject>Natureza</dc:subject>
   <dc:description>This work aims to understand the process of creating the Itatiaia National Park, Brazil's first national park, based on evidence found in the Digital Newspaper Library. This is an ongoing historiographical research project. The first initiatives to create this park involved scientists and people linked to different institutions, as well as supporters of the cause. The year
1917 was significant due to the publication of an official letter regarding its creation, although its implementation only occurred in 1937.</dc:description>
